 {r}←{dry}CopyPackagesToAPLSource flag;sourcePath;targetPath;list;pkg;name;C;F;pkgCfg;R;code_1;code_2;filename;msg;rc;sourcePath2;targetPath2;list2
⍝ Of course Tatin cannot use Tatin to load the packages it depends on, therefore they need to be copied
⍝ to Tatin's APLSource/ folder:
⍝ * If a package is just a class, the class script is copied over
⍝ * If a package is a namespace, the contents of the packages APLSource/ folder is copied into a folder
⍝   that is named like the package, for example "FilesAndDirs"\\
⍝ A detailed report is printed to the session.\\
⍝ The optional left argument `dry` defaults to 0. When a 1 is passed as left argument, all actions are reported
⍝ but not really executed.\\
⍝ As a side effect, older versions (if any) are deleted from the packages folder
 r←0
 dry←{0<⎕NC ⍵:⍎⍵ ⋄ 0}'dry'
 'Invaid left argument'Assert(⊂dry)∊0 1
 C←##.CiderConfig ⋄ F←##.FilesAndDirs ⋄ R←##.Registry
 'Invalid right argument'Assert flag
 sourcePath←C.HOME,'/packages/'
 targetPath←C.HOME,'/APLSource/'
 list←F.ListDirs2 sourcePath
 :If 0<≢list2←{⍵/⍨~{(⍵⍳⍵)=⍳≢⍵}{⊃{⍺,'-',⍵}/2↑'-'(≠⊆⊢)⍵}¨{⊃,/1↓⎕NPARTS ⍵}¨⍵}⊖list
     {}F.RmDirByForce¨list2
 :EndIf
 list~←list2
 ('Source path is empty?! (',sourcePath,')')Assert 0<≢list
 :For pkg :In list
     name←2⊃'-'(≠⊆⊢)((≢'packages/')+1+≢C.HOME)↓pkg
     ⍞←'Processing <',name,'> ...',⎕UCS 10
     pkgCfg←R.GetJsonFromFile pkg,'/apl-package.json'
     sourcePath2←pkg,'/',pkgCfg.source
     :If (⊂3⊃⎕NPARTS sourcePath2)∊'.aplc' '.dyalog'
         ⍞←'  Is a single script',⎕UCS 10
         code_1←⊃⎕NGET sourcePath2 1
         filename←targetPath,name,3⊃⎕NPARTS pkgCfg.source
         code_2←⊃⎕NGET filename 1
         :If code_1≢code_2
             :If ~dry
                 (⊂code_1)⎕NPUT filename 1
             :EndIf
             ⍞←'  Updated!',⎕UCS 10
         :Else
             ⍞←'  Code has not changed, therefore no action is taken',⎕UCS 10
         :EndIf
     :Else
         ⍞←'  Is a namespace',⎕UCS 10
         targetPath2←targetPath,((⊂name)∊'CommTools' '--place-holder--')/'Client/'
         :If CompareFolders sourcePath2(targetPath2,name)
             ⍞←'  Code has not changed, therefore no action is taken',⎕UCS 10
         :Else
             :If ~dry
                 targetPath2 ⎕NCOPY⍠('IfExists' 'Replace')⊢sourcePath2
             :EndIf
             ⍞←'  Updated!',⎕UCS 10
         :EndIf
     :EndIf
 :EndFor
 :If dry
     ⍞←'No action was actually, taken (dry run)',⎕UCS 10
 :Else
     ⍞←'Done',⎕UCS 10
 :EndIf
